---
/**
 * The planner's frame while the client:only island loads: the same boxes as
 * Planner (toolbar, canvas, side panel), so the swap to the live planner moves
 * nothing. The boxes are static and hidden from assistive technology; a
 * visually hidden status line says what is happening instead. The noscript line
 * in index.astro explains a load that never finishes. No inline style
 * attributes: the CSP rejects them.
 */
---

<p class="sr-only" role="status">
  Loading the planner…
</p>
<div aria-hidden="true" class="flex min-h-0 flex-1 flex-col">
  <div class="border-b px-4 py-3">
    <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
      <span class="flex h-9 shrink-0 items-center text-sm leading-none font-medium">New Task</span>
      <div class="bg-muted h-9 w-80 rounded-md motion-safe:animate-pulse"></div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="flex min-h-0 flex-1">
    <div class="bg-muted min-w-0 flex-1"></div>
    <div class="border-sidebar-border bg-sidebar w-80 shrink-0 border-l p-4">
      <div class="bg-sidebar-accent h-5 rounded-md motion-safe:animate-pulse"></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
